+issueNumber: MDL-88604
+notes:
+  core_course:
+    - message: >-
+        The `\core_course\route\controller\course_navigation` class now exposes
+        the public methods `get_section()`, `get_all_section_cms()`,
+        `get_adjacent_section()`, `is_first_navigable()` and
+        `is_last_navigable()` so that the linear navigation footer can detect
+        the first and last navigable activities of a course.
+      type: improved
+  core_courseformat:
+    - message: >-
+        The linear navigation footer no longer displays the "Previous" link on
+        the first activity of the course, and replaces the "Next" link with a
+        "Go to course" link on the last activity of the course. The
+        `core_courseformat/local/linearnavigation/footer_content` template has
+        a new optional `courseurl` context variable.
+      type: improved
